OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHedgehogs worthy banknote winners,
OL,4,Arescuers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FHedgehogs are worthy winners after
OL,7,Ftopping a public vote on which mammals
OL,8,Fshould feature on future Bank of
OL,9,FEngland notes, Sussex wildlife rescuers
OL,10,Fhave said.
OL,12,FThe prickly creatures beat red foxes by
OL,13,F15,000 votes, with nearly half a
OL,14,Fmillion people taking part in the
OL,15,Fconsultation.
OL,17,FEast Sussex Wildlife Rescue and
OL,18,FAmbulance Service, based at Whitesmith,
OL,19,Fnear Chiddingly, is currently looking
OL,20,Fafter 10 hedgehogs and said it was no
OL,21,Fsurprise that hedgehogs had captured
OL,22,Fthe public's imagination.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
