OL,3,GNEWSAHedgehogs worthy banknote winners,
OL,4,Arescuers say
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrevor Weeks, who runs the service,
OL,7,Fsaid each hedgehog had its own distinct
OL,8,Fpersonality.
